claim.claim-text:
a measuring section which is configured to measure vital signs of a subject;
a sensor which is configured to detect a degree of vibration generated in the vital signs measuring apparatus;
a displaying section which is configured to display the vital signs measured by the measuring section; and
a controlling section which is configured to produce a display screen that is to be displayed on the displaying section,
wherein the controlling section is configured to change a display effect of vital signs on the display screen, based on the degree of vibration detected by the sensor.
